<%- include('partials/app-start') %>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-8xl px-3 py-4 sm:px-6 sm:py-6">
    <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 sm:mb-4">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-2xl">Matéria manual</h1>
        <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:text-sm">
          Converse com a IA para pesquisar pautas, escrever e refinar antes de salvar.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/conteudo"
        class="shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300 transition hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-300">
        Criar conteúdo →
      </a>
    </div>

  <div id="mia-manual" class="mia-panel">
    <div class="grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-[250px_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:grid-cols-[290px_minmax(0,1fr)]">
      <aside class="order-2 flex max-h-60 flex-col lg:order-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 p-2.5 sm:max-h-64 lg:max-h-[calc(100vh-13.5rem)] lg:rounded-2xl lg:p-3">
        <button type="button" id="chat-nova"
          class="flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-emerald-400 lg:rounded-xl">
          <span class="text-base leading-none">+</span> Nova matéria
        </button>
        <label class="relative mt-2.5 block lg:mt-3">
          <span class="sr-only">Buscar conversa</span>
          <input id="chat-busca" type="search" placeholder="Buscar por título…"
            class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-100 placeholder:text-slate-600 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none" />
        </label>
        <p class="mt-3 px-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 lg:mt-4 lg:text-[11px]">Suas conversas</p>
        <div id="chat-lista" class="mt-1.5 flex-1 space-y-1 overflow-y-auto pr-1 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <p class="px-1 py-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Carregando…</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 hidden border-t border-slate-800 pt-2 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500 lg:block">
          Cada conversa guarda o histórico. Volte quando quiser para refinar a matéria.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <div class="order-1 flex h-[calc(100svh-13rem)] min-h-[380px] flex-col lg:order-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50 sm:h-[calc(100svh-13rem)] sm:min-h-[480px] lg:h-[calc(100vh-11.5rem)] lg:min-h-[560px] lg:rounded-2xl">
        <header class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2 border-b border-slate-800 px-3 py-2.5 sm:gap-3 sm:px-4 sm:py-3">
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-violet-500/15 text-[11px] font-bold text-violet-300">IA</span>
              <p id="chat-titulo" class="truncate text-sm font-semibold text-white">Nova conversa</p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
              Descreva o assunto ou cole um link — a IA escreve e você refina antes de salvar.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2">
            <button type="button" id="chat-renomear"
              class="hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-slate-300 transition hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-white">Renomear</button>
            <a href="/minhas-materias" class="hidden text-xs text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 sm:inline">Matérias salvas →</a>
          </div>
        </header>

        <div id="chat-mensagens" class="flex-1 space-y-3 overflow-y-auto px-3 py-3 sm:space-y-4 sm:px-4 sm:py-4 lg:space-y-5 lg:py-5">
          <div id="chat-vazio" class="mx-auto max-w-2xl py-3 sm:py-6">
            <p class="text-center text-base font-semibold text-white sm:text-lg">O que vamos noticiar hoje?</p>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-1.5 max-w-md text-center text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400 sm:text-sm">
              Peça um assunto para a IA pesquisar, ou cole um link do
              <strong class="font-medium text-slate-300">Facebook</strong>,
              <strong class="font-medium text-slate-300">Instagram</strong> ou
              <strong class="font-medium text-slate-300">YouTube</strong>.
            </p>

            <ol class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-left sm:mt-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
              <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-3">
                <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-950">1</span>
                <span class="mt-2 block text-xs font-semibold text-white">Peça ou pesquise</span>
                <span class="mt-0.5 block text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Escreva direto, ou use <strong class="font-medium text-slate-300">Pesquisar pautas</strong> para ver o que já saiu e escolher.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-3">
                <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-950">2</span>
                <span class="mt-2 block text-xs font-semibold text-white">Refine no chat</span>
                <span class="mt-0.5 block text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Mude o tom, corrija dados ou peça outro título.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-3">
                <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-950">3</span>
                <span class="mt-2 block text-xs font-semibold text-white">Salve o rascunho</span>
                <span class="mt-0.5 block text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Ele vai para Matérias salvas com arte e legenda.</span>
              </li>
            </ol>

            <p class="mt-4 text-center text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 sm:mt-5">Ou comece com um exemplo</p>
            <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2">
              <button type="button" class="chat-exemplo rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-300 transition hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-white sm:text-xs">Faça uma matéria sobre católicos e evangélicos juntos na política em 2026</button>
              <button type="button" class="chat-exemplo rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-300 transition hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-white sm:text-xs">Faça uma matéria sobre o crescimento das igrejas evangélicas no Brasil</button>
              <button type="button" class="chat-exemplo rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-300 transition hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-white sm:text-xs">Faça uma matéria deste link:</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-slate-800 px-2.5 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 p-2 transition focus-within:border-emerald-500 sm:rounded-2xl">
            <textarea id="chat-input" rows="2"
              placeholder="Descreva o assunto, cole um link ou peça um ajuste…"
              class="max-h-28 min-h-[2.5rem] w-full resize-none bg-transparent px-2 py-1 text-sm text-slate-100 placeholder:text-slate-600 focus:outline-none sm:max-h-36"></textarea>

            <div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 px-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-1" role="group" aria-label="O que a IA deve fazer">
                <button type="button" data-chat-modo="escrever" aria-pressed="true"
                  title="A IA já escreve a matéria com o que você pedir"
                  class="chat-modo-btn rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-950">Escrever matéria</button>
                <button type="button" data-chat-modo="pautas" aria-pressed="false"
                  title="A IA pesquisa o tema e lista as matérias publicadas para você escolher qual reescrever"
                  class="chat-modo-btn rounded-lg px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 hover:text-white">Pesquisar pautas</button>
              </div>

              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-1">
                <button type="button" id="chat-toggle-web" aria-pressed="true"
                  title="Ligado: a IA busca notícias recentes na web. Desligado: escreve apenas com o que você enviar."
                  class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/60 bg-emerald-500/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-200">
                  <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> Pesquisar na web
                </button>
                <select id="chat-periodo" title="A busca considera só notícias publicadas nesse período"
                  class="min-w-0 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-300 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none">
                  <option value="24h">Período: hoje (24h)</option>
                  <option value="3d">Período: 3 dias</option>
                  <option value="7d" selected>Período: 7 dias</option>
                  <option value="15d">Período: 15 dias</option>
                  <option value="30d">Período: 30 dias</option>
                  <option value="60d">Período: 60 dias</option>
                  <option value="90d">Período: 90 dias</option>
                  <option value="180d">Período: 180 dias</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <select id="chat-tom" title="Estilo de escrita da matéria"
                class="min-w-0 rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:outline-none">
                <option value="natural" selected>Tom: natural</option>
                <option value="polemico">Tom: polêmico</option>
                <option value="direto">Tom: direto</option>
                <option value="curiosidade">Tom: curiosidade</option>
                <option value="emocional">Tom: emocional</option>
                <option value="factual">Tom: factual</option>
              </select>

              <div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-2">
                <span id="chat-status" class="max-w-[16rem] truncate text-xs text-slate-500 sm:max-w-xs"></span>
                <button type="button" id="chat-parar"
                  class="hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300 transition hover:border-rose-500 hover:text-rose-200">Parar</button>
                <button type="button" id="chat-enviar"
                  class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 px-5 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-emerald-400">Enviar</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-1.5 px-1 text-[10px] text-slate-600">Enter envia · Shift+Enter quebra linha</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </main>

  <script src="/js/materia-chat.js?v=20260801a"></script>
<%- include('partials/app-end') %>
